&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5417&quot;&gt;Aviva Pension Scheme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5439&quot;&gt; with highly competitive company matching to secure your future &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5565&quot;&gt;Lifestyle Wallet:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5584&quot;&gt; A highly flexible employer-paid benefits spending account to offset expenses like wellness, learning, childcare, and more &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5769&quot;&gt;Access to the best AI tools&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5798&quot;&gt; on the market with continuous AI skill-building opportunities for all employees &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5941&quot;&gt;Time to recharge:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;5960&quot;&gt; Generous paid time off, company holidays, sick time, parental leave, and paid volunteer time off &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
