&lt;li class=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6120&quot;&gt;Exceptional office experience:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-markdown-start-index=&quot;6152&quot;&gt; Catered meals, fully stocked snacks, team social events, and modern workspaces in our London location&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
